			Poët. ap. <i><span class="en">Prisc. p. 709</span></i> P.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">improbitate ita odibilis, ut, etc.,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Lampr. Heliog. 18</span></i>
			; <i><span class="en">Ambros. Ep. 33, 1</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">superbia,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Vulg. Ecclus. 10, 7</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">qui procax est,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. ib. 20, 5</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vita,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 2
					Macc. 6, 19</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Deo,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					Rom. 1, 30</span></i>
			.</div>
